2. Platform terms & official documentation (NOT redistributed)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository does NOT contain verbatim copies of any third-party platform
Terms of Service, EULAs, or official documentation. Redistributing such texts
in full, even with attribution, may violate copyright.

Instead, AegisKit ships only OUR OWN extracted compliance heuristics in
